  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 611.08 Acid Rain Permit Issuance. The department shall review applications for acid rain permits and, provided all applicable criteria have been met, issue the acid rain permit required pursuant to 40 CFR 72 and 40 CFR 76.\n\nSource. #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #6648, INTERIM, eff 12-5-97, EXPIRES: 4-4-98; ss by #6723, eff 3-28-98; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03 (formerly Env-A 611.09); ss by #9906, INTERIM, eff 4-26-11, EXPIRES: 10-24-11; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
